X-WR-CALNAME:Lioness line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-20T03:30:00&endDate=2026-09-20T15:15:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nLIONESS LINE: Sunday 20 September\, until 1615\, no service between Willesden Junction and Watford Junction. Use BAKERLOO LINE services between Willesden Junction and Harrow & Wealdstone. Special bus service 720 operates between Harrow Bus Station and Watford Junction via Harrow & Wealdstone\, Headstone Lane\, Hatch End (Harrow Arts Centre)\, Carpenders Park (Prestwick Road)\, Bushey (Eastbury Road) and Watford High Street. PLEASE NOTE: At this time\, there will be no LONDON NORTH WESTERN RAILWAY services between Euston and Watford Junction\, or SOUTHERN services between Shepherds Bush and Watford Junction.
DTEND:20260920T151500Z
DTSTART:20260920T033000Z
SUMMARY:Lioness line: Part Closure
UID:f83cf705-e6ca-4d25-8960-981aabf32655@f83c.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-12T04:12:42&endDate=2026-09-13T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nLioness Line: No service between Watford Junction and Willesden Junction due to a sewage leak on the track at Watford High Street. MINOR DELAYS on the rest of the line. London Underground is accepting tickets via reasonable route. 
DTEND:20260913T002900Z
DTSTART:20260912T041242Z
SUMMARY:Lioness line: Minor Delays
